    <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#cbd5e1]/80">Collect, verify and investigate activity from POS and inventory systems in one secure place.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff]/10 bg-[#ffffff]/[0.04] p-3.5">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-[#5eead4]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 018 0v4"/></svg>
        <div class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#e2e8f0]">Integrity sealed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff]/10 bg-[#ffffff]/[0.04] p-3.5">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-[#5eead4]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0zM12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg>
        <div class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#e2e8f0]">Suspicious alerts</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff]/10 bg-[#ffffff]/[0.04] p-3.5">
        <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-[#5eead4]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
        <div class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-[#e2e8f0]">Investigations & QA</div>
